OL,3,GNEWSAGloucestershire records first
OL,4,Adeadly virus case
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire has recorded its first
OL,7,Fcase of bluetongue - a virus which can
OL,8,Fbe deadly in livestock.
OL,10,FCases of the insect-borne viral
OL,11,Fdisease, which affects sheep and cattle
OL,12,Fas well as other animals, have risen to
OL,13,F630 across England, Wales and Scotland
OL,14,Fsince the outbreak began in July.
OL,16,FGloucestershire recorded its first case
OL,17,Fon 23 August, according to the latest
OL,18,FDepartment of Environment, Food and
OL,19,FRural Affairs data.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
