OL,3,GNEWSAGloucestershire records first
OL,4,Adeadly virus case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe virus has spread across counties
OL,7,Fquickly because of the hot weather as
OL,8,Fhigh temperatures allow it to develop
OL,9,Fmore quickly in midges.
